  data: {
    LLM: "1. Drawing: Players take turns in anti-clockwise order, drawing the top card from the deck or the last discarded card.\n2. Calling Dompe: After drawing, if a player believes they have the best 5-card hand, they call 'Dompe'. This ends the game after the current round concludes.\n3. Discarding: After drawing (and potentially calling), the player must discard one card.",
    Player: "1. Drawing: Players take turns in anti-clockwise order, drawing the top card from the deck or the last discarded card.\n2. Calling Dompe: After drawing, if a player believes they have the best 5-card hand, they call 'Dompe'. This ends the game after the current round concludes.\n3. Discarding: After drawing (and potentially calling), the player must discard one card.",
